  "content": "<center>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/label.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p><img style=display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/progress.png\" width=\"621\" height=\"35\"></p>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-gui-hud-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/dark_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"375\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/bedrock_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"375\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n\n<p><img style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: center; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/showcase.png\"></p>\n\n</center>\n<hr>\n\n<blockquote>\n<p>«厌倦了Minecraft枯燥的默认界面？每次靠近附魔台却只看到与工作台一样的灰色菜单？想为游戏增添一抹色彩？</p>\n<p>隆重推出彩色容器！这款容器界面替换模组，旨在让每个界面与Minecraft中丰富多彩的可交互方块相匹配»</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>—— Chris XENO</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h2 style=\"line-height: normal;\">如今我带来了全新<strong>重</strong>制、<strong>重</strong>绘、<strong>重</strong>构的版本——多彩容器，支持新版本、全新纹理，沉浸感更上一层楼！</h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\">所有GUI均从对应方块中汲取灵感进行了改造。修复了原版Minecraft纹理、HUD变化，甚至加入了原版动画GUI，还有更多<strong>更多</strong>内容！</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/changes.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>改动纹理图示：</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/graphic.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2988\" height=\"5328\"></p>\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>改动纹理列表：</summary>\n<ul>\n<li>工作台</li>\n<li>铁砧 <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>附魔台 <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>酿造台</li>\n<li>织布机</li>\n<li>制图台 <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>切石机 <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>砂轮</li>\n<li>锻造台 <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>合成器 <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>投掷器、发射器 <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>熔炉、高炉、烟熏炉 <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>漏斗</li>\n<li>箱子</li>\n<li>运输船 <em>(1.21.2+)</em></li>\n<li>运输矿车</li>\n<li>鹦鹉螺及僵尸鹦鹉螺</li>\n<li>村民</li>\n<li>物品栏</li>\n<li>配方书</li>\n<li>书</li>\n<li>信标</li>\n<li>HUD</li>\n<li>经验条 <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>部分UI小改动和修复</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>「原版增强」功能</strong>（更多信息请阅读「安装指南」）：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>村民职业界面 <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>末影箱 <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>马、骷髅马、僵尸马</li>\n<li>骆驼、骡、驴、羊驼</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>OptiFine/OptiGUI 功能：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>村民类型和职业全组合界面 <em>(OptiGUI 独占) </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(Animatica 独占)</em></li>\n<li>末影箱</li>\n<li>陷阱箱</li>\n<li>圣诞节箱子</li>\n<li>铜箱子及变种 <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>木桶 <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>彩色潜影盒</li>\n<li>马、骷髅马、僵尸马</li>\n<li>骆驼、骡、驴（带/不带箱子 - <em>OptiGUI 独占</em>）</li>\n<li>羊驼（带地毯颜色）</li>\n<li>有裂纹、损坏的铁砧 <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>成书 <em>(OptiGUI+Animatica 独占) </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li>讲台上的书 <em>(OptiGUI 3.0+ 独占)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>模组支持：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Accessories</li>\n<li>Armor Chroma</li>\n<li>Axiom</li>\n<li>Backslot <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>Charm of Undying <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>Better Enchanting</li>\n<li>Cloth Config</li>\n<li>Detail Armor Bar</li>\n<li>ItemSwapper</li>\n<li>Language Reload</li>\n<li>Mod Menu</li>\n<li>Recursive Resources</li>\n<li>Sawmill</li>\n<li>They Up To</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n\n\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/installation.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n<center>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">如需完整体验，需要安装 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine</h3>\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/optigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optigui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://optifine.net/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optifine.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n</center>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>如果你不想使用 OptiGUI，或只使用 OptiFine 模组，可以在语言设置中激活内置的「原版增强」模式</h3>\n\n<details>\n<summary>如何使用：</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/vanilla_version.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1390\" height=\"340\"></p>\n<p>如需其他语言支持，请使用版本页面主文件下方的独立「VANILLA+」资源包</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/modrinth_additional_files.png\" width=\"627\" height=\"267\" alt=\"\"></p>\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/q&amp;a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"103\"></p>\n<details>\n<summary>问答：</summary>\n<h4><strong>问：如果我有列表之外的问题，该去哪里询问？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">多彩容器Discord服务器</a> 并在那里提问！</p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>已知问题列表：</summary>\n<h4><strong>使用 OptiFine 时：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>村民职业不生效</li>\n<li>木桶显示箱子GUI纹理</li>\n<li>运输船显示最近访问过的类箱子容器GUI纹理</li>\n<li>部分类似马的生物不受支持</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果只使用 OptiFine，建议使用「原版增强」模式</p>\n</details>\n\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong>问：箱子/潜影盒/村民职业界面不生效！</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>请检查是否已安装 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine，或者已将语言切换为「原版增强」</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>问：能否添加对 X 模组的支持？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>简单来说：理论上可以。请在评论中留下建议，或提交到Discord服务器！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>问：我能否在整合包中使用多彩容器 / 能否修改多彩容器 / 能否对多彩容器进行 X 操作？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>请查阅描述底部「使用条款」</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>问：我想支持你！该怎么做？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>关于这个……</p>\n</details>\n\n\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/support.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3086\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1501\" height=\"160\"></a></p>\n<h3>如果你不需要服务器但仍想支持我，<strong>请将这个资源包分享给朋友，或在YouTube、TikTok、Instagram等平台上展示！</strong>只需留下本页链接，我将不胜感激！</h3>\n<hr>\n<center>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>别忘了点赞和关注，以获取未来更新！</strong></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/modrinth.png\" width=\"215\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"60\"></a></p>\n</center>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/credits.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/chris_xeno/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Chris_XENO</a></strong> —— 原始彩色容器纹理包的作者</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Shrimpsnail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Shrimpsnail</a></strong> —— 协助编写自定义着色器代码，许多功能得以实现都归功于他</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Kryqu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Kryqu</a></strong> —— 村民GUI的灵感来源</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/terms.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>使用条款：</summary>\n<p><strong>如果你觉得无法对这个资源包进行某项操作，请提前询问我 :)</strong></p>\n<h3><strong>你可以：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>将本资源包包含在免费的整合包中</li>\n<li>将本资源包用于私人服务器</li>\n<li>修改本资源包（仅限个人使用）</li>\n<li>在YouTube、Twitch等任何形式的媒体中使用本资源包</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>你不可以：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>未经本人同意，在任何平台以任何形式分发本资源包及其资产、修改后的资产</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<hr>",
